  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Zambian Government to Strengthen its Institutional Capacity and Multi-Sectoral Coordination Concerning Sexual and Gender-Based Violence (SGBV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Service contract for provision of technical assistance to government at national level concerning strengthening of Governments institutional and policy capacities and multi-sectoral coordination. Contract covers1 full-time key expert supported by an estimated number of 340 working days for non-key experts and an envelope of EUR 250,000 for incidental expenditure (including visibility and communication related expenditure).</narrative>
  </description>
